# Canonical .dockerignore for a fleet Yarn-workspace app. Copy to the
# repo root as `.dockerignore`. Keeps the build context small and the
# install layer cache-stable; crucially, KEEPS `.yarn/releases` +
# `.yarn/plugins` (the vendored Yarn the builder needs) while dropping
# the churny cache/state.
.git
.github
.forgejo
.gitea
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/storybook-static
**/coverage
**/__screenshots__
**/__snapshots__
.yarn/cache
.yarn/install-state.gz
.yarn/unplugged
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
